  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "pH 5.6"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "Wash potatoes with tap water, peel and cut into 1 cm cubes. Rinse with tap water quickly and boil 200 g of potato cubes with 1 L of distilled water for 20 min. Mash and squeeze through a muslin bag. Add agar and boil till melted. Add yeast extract and glucose, and stir till dissolved. Make up to 1 L. Adjust pH. Autoclave to sterilize."
    }
  ]
